piece of functionality that can be applied to different forms as long as they share a common
interface. There are different definitions of polymorphism in OOP, and we will distinguish
between two main types:
Static or early binding: This form of polymorphism happens when the
application is compiled.
Dynamic or late binding: This form of polymorphism happens when the
